    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezera bweyali ng'ali kusaba bw'ayatula ebibi, eno nga bw'alira amaziga ng'akubye amakiryaivu gha mberi gh'eisinzizo lya Katonda, eikuukuubira ery'Abaisiraeli abasaadha n'abakazi n'abaana abato, lyesololeza gh'ali. Boonaboona nga bali kulira inho amaziga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Shekania mutabane wa Yehieli owundi ku batabane ba Elamu yaakoba Ezera ati: “Tusungughaiza inho Katonda waife, olw'okubayiza abakazi abamaghanga agandi agali mu nsi eno. Aye waire ebyo biri bityo, Isiraeli ekaaliyo n'eisuubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni tukole endagaano ni Katonda waife, tutoolegho abakazi abo n'abaana baibwe, nga tujiira ku magezi ge tunaafuna okuva ye iwe musengwa wange, ni y'abo boonaboona abagondera ebiragiro bya Katonda waife oyo. Ekyo twidha kukikola nga tujiira ku mateeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Situkiramu, kuba ogwo mulimo gwo era ife tuli ghalala n'iwe. Iwe guma okikole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezera yaasituka, yaakoba abakulembeze ba bakabona, n'aba Abalevi, n'aba Abaisiraeli boonaboona, balayire bati baidha kwawukana n'abakazi abamaghanga agandi. Kale baakola omukolo ogw'okulayira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Ezera yaava mu luya emberi gh'eisinzizo lya Katonda, yaaja mu kisenge kya Yehohanani mutabane wa Eliashibu, yaaba eyo okutuusa obwire okukya nga tali kulya waire okunhwa ekintu kyonakyona ng'enaku emugemye olw'Abaisiraeli abaava mu bunhage obutaba beesigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho baalangirira mu Buyudaaya mwonamwona ni mu Yerusalemu, bati abo boonaboona abaira okuva mu bunhage beesololeze e Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era bati anaamala enaku eisatu ng'akaali kwidha, ng'abakungu n'abakulembeze bwe balagiire, ebintu bye byonabyona baja kubimutoolaku, ni mwene yeena bamubinge mu kikunsu eky'abaava mu bunhage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abasaadha boonaboona ab'omu kika kya Yuda n'ekya Benjamini, beesololeza e Yerusalemu mu nnaku eisatu edho. Olwo n'olwali olunaku olwamakumi abiri (20) olw'omwezi ogwomwenda. Abantu boonaboona baatyama mu luya emberi gh'eisinzizo lya Katonda nga bali kudhugumira, olw'ensonga eyabeesa n'olw'amaadhi amangi einho agaali gali kugwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezera kabona yaasituka yaakoba abantu ati: “Mwayonoona okubayiza abakazi abamaghanga agandi, kuba mwayongera bwongere ku musango ensi Isiraeli gw'eri nagwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni mpegaano mwatule ebibi byaimwe eri Musengwa Katonda, oyo Katonda wa badhaadha baife, mukolenga ebyo by'ayenda. Mweyawule ku bantu abamaghanga agandi abali mu nsi eno, ni ku bakazi baimwe abamaghanga agandi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abantu boonaboona abaali beesoloiza bamwiramu nga baleekaana bati: “N'ekyo kyene. Tuteekwa kukola nga bw'okobye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye tuli abantu kamaala ate amaadhi gali kugwa mangi, titukaaghanga kugabaamu tuti. Ate era, ekintu ekyo titusobola kukikola mu lunaku lulala oba ibiri, kuba bwenebwene abaayonoona bangi inho mu ife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leka abakulembeze baife babeegho mu liina lyaife twenatwena abeesoloiza. Olwo ab'omu bibuga byaife boonaboona abaabayiza abakazi abamaghanga agandi, baidhe mu kiseera ekiragaane nga bali ghalala n'abakulembeze n'abalamuzi okuva mu buli kibuga. Mu nsambo eyo ekiruyi ekitaloodheka Katonda waife ky'ali nakyo ku ife ku nsonga eyo, kiidha kutuvaaku.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghazira muntu yatakania ntegeka eyo, okutoolaku Yonathani mutabane wa Asaheli ni Yahazeia mutabane wa Tikuva, nga bayambibwaku Meshullamu ni Shabbethai Omulevi, boona abaali nga baisania nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale abaava mu bunhage baikiriza entegeka eyo. Ezera yaalonda abandi ku baakuliranga enda dha baiseibwe, ng'ajiira ku nda dhe basimukamu era amaina gaibwe gaaghandiikibwa. Ku lunaku olusooka mu mwezi ogweikumi, baatyama baatoolera okunoonereza ku nsonga eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era olunaku olusooka, mu mwezi ogusooka mu mwaka, lwaja okutuuka nga bamaze okuzuula abasaadha abaali babayiiza abakazi abamaghanga agandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
